WEBVTT

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:05.230
In any event, we shall be taking our leave.

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:08.230
Excuse me.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.190
Hello?

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.580
I told you that wasn't necessary.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:13.700
What?

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.200
Fine.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.380
Only for today.

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:18.770
What's going on?

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:20.980
They want to drive me home.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.430
I said I'd walk, but...

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:27.170
They? You mean your rich family?

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:29.450
They run a hotel or something, right?

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:31.140
What?! A hotel?!

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:32.130
Wow.

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:35.320
I said I'd be fine camping out somewhere,

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:36.800
but they just wouldn't listen.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.640
I'm staying at my parent's hotel currently.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.180
What hotel?

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:45.750
I think it was called the 
Great Cormorant Bayside.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:46.810
What?!

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:53.440
That's a super high-end hotel, isn't it?!

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:54.770
It is?

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:59.830
<b>Station</b>

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:59.830
<b>Planetarium</b>

00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:58.620
You know, it's that high-rise 
connected to Yotaka Station!

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:01.330
You mean the place with the 
planetarium and the aquarium?

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:01.330
<b>Aquarium</b>

00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:05.350
Yeah, that entire building 
is the Great Cormorant!

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:06.830
Wow!

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:11.340
I want to stay at your place tonight!

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:12.590
What?

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:14.670
If you're the daughter of the 
people who own the hotel,

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:17.480
then you'd be staying in a suite on 
the top floor, or something, right?

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:20.910
Yeah. I said I'd be fine with the 
garbage room, but you know...

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:24.410
Hey! I live on the top floor, too!

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:28.690
<b>Old Japanese Style</b>

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:26.340
It's just the second floor 
of an old wooden building.

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:28.420
And what made you think that'd 
make me want to visit you?

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:39.950
<b>Special Private
Collection</b>

00:01:28.930 --> 00:01:30.760
I don't have a planetarium,

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:32.360
but I do have a special set of moments

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:38.210
I've recorded and taken photographs 
of you during this entire time!

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:39.950
Then I'll go and burn it all up.

00:01:40.810 --> 00:01:42.330
No!

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:45.660
Hey, Yasuhiro...

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:48.500
I don't have anything to do tomorrow, so...

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.380
<i>Misha's actually asking me for something?!</i>

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:54.340
Then I'm going to sleep over, too!

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:57.780
<i>Kamoi's going to be in my room...</i>

00:01:58.370 --> 00:02:00.260
<i>Sh-She's going to sleep there...</i>

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:04.380
You don't mind, do you?

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:05.700
You don't mind, right?

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:07.160
I-It's fine...

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:09.480
<b>Stay at home</b>

00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:09.480
<i>I guess I get to sit here.</i>

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:12.010
Let's go! Let's right now!

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:12.860
Sure.

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:15.080
They're waiting outside, too.

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:16.160
I'm stuck at home...

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:22.370
Good evening, ma'am.

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:24.550
Will I be taking the two 
ladies with you, as well?

00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:26.620
Yes, they'll be staying at my place.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.380
Understood.

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:29.580
Please get in.

00:02:30.770 --> 00:02:32.380
See you later!

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:34.130
Bye...

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:38.160
There's a thug-looking guy that came to 
pick up those girls in a black car...

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:39.840
It must be their pimp, or something.

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:41.630
His daughter went with them.

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:43.370
I bet she didn't want to live there anymore.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:46.190
Ever since those maids showed up,

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:49.020
everyone's saying weird stuff about me...

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.190
Bayside!

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.490
Wow!

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:26.990
<b>Super Shark VS Super Shark</b>

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:30.240
<b>Episode 8:   My Former Maid Is From A Good Family</b>

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:26.990
The TV's so big!

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:28.490
The bath area's so big!

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:30.240
The bed's so big!

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:33.250
There's a tent next to the bed?!

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:36.480
Yes, this is where I sleep.

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:37.890
In a sleeping bag inside.

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:38.540
Why?

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:42.600
I mean this room just feels way too nice.

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:44.770
It's the best room, so...

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:47.470
It's too luxurious, I feel 
like I can't breathe.

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:51.180
I set the AC to 16 degrees C 
and shiver myself to sleep.

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:53.350
You're weird.

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:55.840
Now that I think about it, 
ever since I was young,

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:58.800
everything was so nice, 
I just couldn't handle it.

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:01.520
So you're saying that your 
current personality was created

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:03.300
due to the hard rejection 
of that environment?

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:04.700
Possibly.

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:12.200
Midori
Someone else

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:07.600
I kind of kept myself sane by thinking that

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:10.560
they mixed up the babies at the hospital

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:12.950
and I'm not actually supposed to live here.

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:16.710
<b>Someone purposely switched the kids (her imagination)</b>

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:16.710
Sounds like something a 
shrink needs to handle.

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:19.680
And then, when the pressure of 
having to take everything over

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:22.490
for my parents was about 
to cause me to crack...

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:24.320
My younger brother was born.

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:26.020
A sixteen year difference.

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:28.040
So cute!

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:30.530
Since I've convinced myself 
that I was switched at birth,

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:32.960
you're not blood-related!

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:35.830
Instead of having this 
troubled girl succeed us...

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:38.850
...we should just raise our 
son to take over instead.

00:05:39.140 --> 00:05:41.110
You go and do whatever you want.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:44.650
And that's how I came to 
the decision to join the force.

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:45.740
Specifically because I 
thought it'd be hard on me.

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:47.640
I see...

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:50.960
That being said, I'm still 
their only daughter.

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:52.660
If I try to go too far off the rails,

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:55.470
they trap me in a place like this.

00:05:55.470 --> 00:05:58.370
I wish someone would trap 
me in a place like this.

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:04.920
Such a waste of a nice soft bed.

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:06.530
You can sleep there.

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:11.620
Then I'll have to sleep in this bed, too.

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:15.880
I mean it's a suite, but there's 
only this one king-sized bed here.

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:17.060
You sleep on the floor.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:18.730
You mean without so much 
as a sleeping bag even?!

00:06:19.010 --> 00:06:20.960
I'm sure the floor's made 
out of a good material.

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:22.670
It'll improve your blood circulation,

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:23.940
kind of like a stone sauna.

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:26.440
Don't just make stuff up!

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:29.820
I'll sleep on the floor, 
so you can have the sleeping bag.

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:31.950
That's not the problem here!

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:35.200
What a pain...

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:38.330
Okay, then. Midorin, you sleep next to me.

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:41.740
And then you can sleep next to Midorin.

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:46.220
If you climb over Midorin to get to me...

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:48.510
I'll kill... you...

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:55.150
She fell asleep like she 
ran out of batteries!

00:06:55.150 --> 00:06:56.840
So cute!

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:58.060
Wh-What do you want to do?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:00.060
Isn't it obvious?

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:03.230
Maids follow their master's orders!

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:07.480
What's the problem with sleeping in a 
luxurious bed every once in a while?

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:09.990
I-I see.

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:19.620
First Lieutenant, you're in the way.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:20.620
<b>Love</b>

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:20.910
So mean!

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:24.370
Though, I'll make sure I get a suite

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:27.130
so I can sleep in the same bed as 
Milady for our honeymoon.

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:31.510
This really is a good bed, though.

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:34.920
Yes, there's no pain to the back or hips.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:37.260
It's soft, and it smells good.

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:41.570
<i>Also, your face is so close to mine.</i>

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:45.020
Oh, crap.

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:47.230
Everything's so nice, my body's rejecting it.

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:48.860
Your body is weird.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.540
How about you sleep in 
your sleeping bag, then?

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:54.800
Then I'll just have to sleep 
directly next to Milady.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:56.200
No, I'm fine.

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:57.280
Yay.

00:07:57.760 --> 00:07:59.450
It doesn't look that way.

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:02.480
A maid must listen to their master's orders.

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:05.600
Well, as long as you're 
not dead when I wake up.

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:07.000
It'd be a pain to deal with that.

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:08.710
Good night.

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:09.960
Yeah.

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:11.560
Good night.

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:19.750
I slept well.

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:20.600
Huh?

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:28.030
Oh, is morning already?

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:32.090
I knew it wouldn't be good to sleep 
in a bed that felt this good.

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:33.740
A-Are you okay?

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:37.700
My hands and feet feel 
like ice, but I'm fine.

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.120
Sounds like there's a problem to me.

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:41.320
Where's that woman, anyway?

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:47.640
You told me not to come near you,

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:50.880
so I'm gazing upon you from above.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:51.840
You think you're so smart!

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:56.800
<b>Maid-san</b>

00:08:52.150 --> 00:08:56.800
Don't worry, we'll be right 
back after a short break.

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:04.600
In any event, under normal circumstances, 
I'd start making breakfast, but...

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:08.690
I assume you would like to eat 
something from the hotel today.

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:13.690
You do all this crazy stuff then go 
back to acting like a normal maid.

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:17.320
But I would like to eat breakfast here.

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:21.240
Then we can either order room service 
or eat at the buffet downstairs.

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:23.000
<b>Chicken and Rice</b>

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.000
<b>Vienna Sausages</b>

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.000
<b>Mackerel</b>

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:26.000
I'll eat some cold canned goods here.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.500
Come with us!

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:31.760
Previously I tried using some solid 
fuel, things caught on fire,

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:33.630
and then the sprinklers activated.

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:35.530
So I can't eat anything warm here.

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:36.860
They got really mad at me.

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:38.080
<i>Yay.</i>

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:39.890
Then come with us.

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:43.980
Also, there are emperor penguins 
at this aquarium, right?

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:45.760
I want to see them after we eat.

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:48.360
I have some free passes, so you should go.

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:51.040
You come with us, Midorin.

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:52.020
But...

00:09:52.390 --> 00:09:54.900
You should follow her orders.

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:57.910
Fine.

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:05.660
Wow!

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:07.410
This is good!

00:10:09.610 --> 00:10:11.160
My nose is bleeding again.

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:12.300
Come on...

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:15.920
<b>Emperor Penguin</b>

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:20.400
Emperor penguins are strong, 
and when they hit you with their wings,

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:23.280
they can even break a 
human's bones, supposedly.

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:25.180
You know so much!

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:26.680
I see!

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:27.950
Bring it on!

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:30.190
Midorin!

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.820
So pretty!

00:10:35.220 --> 00:10:37.940
Yeah, you really are.

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:39.950
Look at the stars.

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:44.280
<b>Trying to sit up in the aisle</b>

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:44.280
And you sit normally!

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:54.170
This is...

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:56.670
...great!

00:10:56.670 --> 00:11:01.680
Milady, you should run around 
like an elementary schooler.

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:04.440
Let's ride the orca!

00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:05.820
Where's Midorin?

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:08.840
She went to the pool over 
there a minute ago...

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:16.070
Why are you doing special 
forces water training?!

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:22.770
Someone drowned!

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:25.080
Just be normal!

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:28.830
It wasn't perfect, but I had fun.

00:11:29.310 --> 00:11:31.160
Thank you for today, Midorin.

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:33.900
I'm glad you had fun.

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:35.670
<b>Job magazine</b>

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:35.670
First Lieutenant, what's that?

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:39.260
Well, I have to look for a job soon.

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:41.220
<i>Oh, yeah.</i>

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:43.360
<i>It's almost been a month,</i>

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:45.840
<i>so Midorin won't have a job.</i>

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:48.820
I'd like to keep you on,

00:11:48.820 --> 00:11:51.270
but Yasuhiro said I can't have both of you.

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:52.820
Don't worry about it.

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:54.150
Just the way it is.

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:56.400
Do you have something you'd like to do?

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:59.980
Something as hard as possible, 
where you get yelled at for no reason.

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:02.040
Something where no one is 
grateful for what you do.

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:05.820
Something with extremely low pay that doesn't 
match the job description or hours worked.

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:07.530
I think there's tons of those.

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:12.630
I think there are plenty of places who'd 
love to hire you for something like that,

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:16.090
but I think it'd be better 
if you took care of yourself.

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:16.960
That's true.

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:19.800
My parents get mad at me 
when I say things like this.

00:12:20.040 --> 00:12:21.350
I know we told you to do whatever you want,

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:22.420
but that doesn't mean "whatever"!

00:12:22.850 --> 00:12:24.680
Also...

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:29.810
It'd be nice if it was someplace 
close to where you work.

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:35.270
So our neighborhood?

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:37.780
It's a residential area, so there's 
not going to be anything there.

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:38.820
Actually...

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:41.590
Why don't you marry Midorin?

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:43.490
You'd be a housewife and 
never have to work again.

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:44.570
What?!

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:48.640
She seems to really like you.

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:50.560
Besides you can legally marry overseas

00:12:50.560 --> 00:12:53.050
Guess we'll have to if our master ordered it.

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:54.710
Of course not!

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:56.440
In terms of how strong 
our respective loves are,

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:58.630
my love for Milady is 
much stronger than yours!

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:01.250
<b>Pressure</b>

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:00.360
Let's get married.

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:01.250
No.

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:04.220
Even though I love you so much?

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:07.010
I don't like you at all.

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:08.680
And if you're going to be that way,

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:11.370
then why say what you did
when I don't like you at all?!

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:12.020
<b>Love</b>

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:12.020
So mean!

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:14.190
Don't be so mean to her!

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:15.140
Completely contradictory!

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:18.900
Aren't you being overly 
nice to the Lieutenant?

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:20.110
I mean, it's a wonderful sentiment, but...

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:24.990
I mean, she can't really
do much— just feel bad for her.

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:30.960
I've seen a bird tear off 
its own feathers before.

00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:33.500
Midorin feels like the bird I saw, in a way.

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:35.970
That's why I think you should marry her.

00:13:35.970 --> 00:13:37.440
I'm sure she needs you.

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:39.390
The logic doesn't work!

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:43.130
I guess even a little kid 
is that worried about me.

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:47.330
But I am an adult, 
and I want to live my life.

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:49.140
I'll make do on my own.

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:57.020
<b>Bank Account</b>

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:57.020
I'll be a parasite to my parents and slowly 
take their money until I find a job.

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:58.380
Midorin...

00:13:58.380 --> 00:13:59.400
Lieutenant...

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:02.100
I know I don't have much 
time left working for you,

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:03.290
but I hope we have fun until the end.

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:06.280
Milady!

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:07.780
Shut up!

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:12.030
<i>The sadness and anxiety of 
my maid work ending here...</i>

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:14.500
<i>I'd normally get excited over that,</i>

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:18.040
<i>but I wonder why I'm just 
feeling sad instead.</i>

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.880
<b>A Few Days Later</b>

00:14:22.140 --> 00:14:24.050
Thank you for everything.

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:25.670
Be well, Lieutenant.

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:28.300
We'll get to see each other soon.

00:14:28.480 --> 00:14:29.860
No, that's okay.

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:31.240
Seriously.

00:14:31.240 --> 00:14:34.240
Sorry, I asked Yasuhiro again,

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:36.310
but he can't hire you both.

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:38.910
Your feelings are enough.

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:42.310
Thank you.

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:47.760
See you later.

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:52.410
Midorin...

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:55.950
Midorin!

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:58.740
Midorin!

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:01.120
<b>A Week Later</b>

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:06.070
It's been a week since Midorin left...

00:15:06.070 --> 00:15:07.550
So boring.

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:10.050
<b>Jealousy</b>

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:10.050
Milady likes the First Lieutenant!

00:15:10.420 --> 00:15:12.800
I wonder if she found a new job yet.

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:16.780
The Lieutenant said herself 
that she's an adult,

00:15:16.780 --> 00:15:19.040
and that she'll figure it out on her own.

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:21.270
Life is hard.

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:24.440
Yes?

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:26.780
My name is Ukai. I've moved in next door.

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.280
Nice to meet you.

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:29.530
What?

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:31.400
I've made some soba.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.160
I'm here to say hello.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:34.660
But why?

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:37.360
I used my severance to do forex,

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:40.120
or whatever it's called, 
for fun and to get rid of my money,

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:42.310
but instead I made tons of money off it.

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:45.630
I just was messing around, so I have 
no clue why I made that much money.

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:49.630
So I decided to buy the house next 
to yours, and start my own business.

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:51.010
I'm still getting everything ready, though.

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:52.560
Your own business?

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:54.510
I want to do house cleaning.

00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:58.780
I figured out that I'm good 
at cleaning having worked here.

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:01.170
I have you two to thank.

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:03.560
I wanted to say thank you, Kamoi, Misha.

00:16:04.550 --> 00:16:06.070
That's great!

00:16:06.070 --> 00:16:08.660
We haven't really done 
anything for you to thank us,

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:10.940
but I think you're rather suited to that.

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:13.810
Yes, I'll get to work in 
houses that are dumps,

00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:15.450
and take care of places
where people died alone...

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:17.490
It'll be lots of fun!

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:19.430
Th-That's great...

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:24.960
<b>Uzamaid!</b>

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:29.960
<b>Uzamaid!</b>

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:35.680
What's wrong, Kamoi?

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:37.850
Don't jump over from your roof...

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:40.100
Shut up! You'll annoy the neighbors.

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:41.310
Sorry...

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:43.350
A-Actually, this is a problem!

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:46.280
Your underwear is missing!

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:47.190
What?!

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:51.040
Midorin, call the police immediately.

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:51.990
Roger that.

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:55.240
You're treating me as the suspect already!

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:57.070
It wasn't me!

00:16:57.480 --> 00:16:59.950
I mean, think about what I did before.

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:08.490
You probably just wanted to convince us that

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:11.580
you wouldn't do something 
like this, and then did.

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:12.880
It was premeditated.

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:15.130
I'm telling you that's wrong!

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:17.270
Besides, if I stole them...

00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:18.180
Stop!

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:18.890
Huh?

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:22.640
Recording 1

00:17:19.170 --> 00:17:25.480
<i>I stole them...</i>

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:27.160
I have your confession.

00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:29.400
Don't just take that one part of my sentence!

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:31.560
Well, hold on a second, Misha.

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:33.440
Your hand! Your hand!

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:36.220
Even if Kamoi was the perpetrator,

00:17:36.220 --> 00:17:39.410
it would be strange for her to scream 
and have us look to see what was up.

00:17:39.590 --> 00:17:40.510
That's true!

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:41.700
You're smart, Midorin!

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:44.960
That's what I've been trying to say...

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:49.290
Besides, why did you think that 
Misha's panties were stolen?

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:52.120
I had noticed that one pair of 
Milady's panties were missing

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:55.930
from the laundry basket when I was 
trying to hang up her clothes.

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:58.110
And what about the possibility 
that you're mistaken?

00:17:58.110 --> 00:17:59.220
There isn't any!

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:02.930
I know all of Milady's panties!

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:15.430
Creepy!

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:16.690
Wow...

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:21.360
In any event, there's no doubt that 
Milady's panties have been stolen!

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:24.200
We need to find who did this immediately!

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:37.260
There's no evidence a ladder was placed against, or rope tied to the railing—

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:39.720
nothing to imply infiltration 
from the outside.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:41.330
What about fingerprints?

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:43.090
There were some.

00:18:43.090 --> 00:18:44.600
Whose were they?

00:18:44.980 --> 00:18:46.350
Mine.

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:48.100
What about those footprints?

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:49.850
They're mine.

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:53.360
<b>Silence</b>

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:55.830
Midorin, call the police.

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:58.110
The circumstantial evidence 
speaks for itself.

00:18:58.310 --> 00:19:01.320
I'm telling you it wasn't me!

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:05.160
Why steal panties, anyway?

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:07.370
Maybe someone really wanted that pair?

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:09.560
That doesn't make sense.

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:10.370
So why, then?

00:19:10.780 --> 00:19:13.540
Well, the typical panty thief...

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:15.300
<b>Panties Acquired</b>

00:19:14.140 --> 00:19:16.050
...wear the panties they steal on their hand.

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:17.550
<b>Panties Check</b>

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:18.550
They smell them...

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:25.560
<b>Panties World</b>

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:22.410
They spread them all out over 
the floor and roll over them.

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:23.960
And roll over them.

00:19:23.960 --> 00:19:25.560
That's how it goes.

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:27.310
You sure know a lot about that.

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:28.510
I bet you did it.

00:19:28.510 --> 00:19:29.930
I didn't!

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:33.790
It's not me, honestly.

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:35.290
Huh?

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:41.150
I remember everything, now!

00:19:41.900 --> 00:19:43.090
That's right...

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:46.810
I was hanging the clothes to dry...

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:49.800
Delivery!

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:50.660
Coming!

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:57.020
I couldn't just leave Milady's precious 
panties just sitting there on the deck.

00:19:57.540 --> 00:20:01.920
So I just had to put them in 
a safe location, temporarily.

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:03.260
Safe location?

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:05.550
Right here!

00:20:07.830 --> 00:20:10.680
And while I was carrying 
the package we got...

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:13.030
I completely forgot!

00:20:13.030 --> 00:20:13.730
Tee-hee.

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:18.980
The "Blue Bird of Happiness" was 
right beside me this entire time!

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:21.380
Midorin, call the police.

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:22.430
Seriously.

00:20:22.430 --> 00:20:23.760
Goodbye, Kamoi.

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:26.370
Please don't!

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:31.370
<b>Uzamaid!</b>

00:20:33.940 --> 00:20:34.990
What's wrong, Kamoi?!

00:20:34.990 --> 00:20:37.870
Don't just come in here like you belong here!

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:39.590
I told you to stop being so loud!

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:41.160
I'm sorry.

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:43.080
B-But this is terrible!

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:46.200
My underwear has gone missing this time!

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:46.950
What?!

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:51.720
My clothes got a bit dirty while cleaning,

00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:54.180
so I decided to borrow your shower,

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:56.860
but when I returned to the changing 
area, my underwear was...

00:20:58.510 --> 00:21:00.650
Did you take them?

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:02.240
That'd never happen!

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:06.550
Actually, wouldn't Midorin 
have plenty of motive?

00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:08.070
No, I wouldn't...

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:11.560
The First Lieutenant would 
never do something like that.

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:12.720
Really?

00:21:12.720 --> 00:21:18.430
Yes, she'd wear the same panties 
as me, and get off on that.

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:23.730
She's a lot worse than 
your average panty thief.

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:26.920
I'm so happy you understand me,

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:29.470
and then you're also degrading 
me—makes me even happier.

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:32.220
You can just go home and get another pair.

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:33.900
Just go home like that.

00:21:33.900 --> 00:21:35.380
You're wearing a long skirt, too.

00:21:35.380 --> 00:21:37.350
Milady, you're not 
treating this properly.

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:40.490
I can't go home without panties...

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:42.360
I'd be embarrassed.

00:21:42.640 --> 00:21:44.210
What are you talking about?

00:21:44.210 --> 00:21:46.320
You wear so many worse things.

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:48.480
You want mine?

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:49.950
No, that's okay.

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:52.700
Mens

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:52.700
The only other thing we 
have would be Yasuhiro's.

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:56.810
Think about this a bit more seriously!

00:21:56.810 --> 00:21:59.160
If a thief did break in here,

00:21:59.160 --> 00:22:01.340
it'd be terrible!

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:02.710
<b>Don't take those!</b>

00:22:03.710 --> 00:22:05.470
<b>Sorry.</b>

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:09.970
<b>Japanese Subtitles: Kouno Takamitsu</b>
